flowchart TB
accTitle: Separate API usage management from player authorization
accDescr: API Gateway applies client usage controls and player authorization before Lambda accesses keyed session records in DynamoDB.
C[Mobile REST client]:::external --> G[API Gateway REST API]:::process
K[API key and usage plan]:::reference -.->|Meter and throttle client usage| G
A[Player token and authorizer]:::reference -.->|Authorize player access| G
G --> L[Stateless Lambda game operation]:::process
L --> D[(DynamoDB session by player ID)]:::storage
D --> R[REST response]:::output
N[API key is not player authentication]:::warning -.-> K
